1
00:00:13,839 --> 00:00:16,965
We'd have some money if Khun Pam still

2
00:00:17,013 --> 00:00:18,853
wanted to buy your old house in Ayutthaya

3
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,160
Thank you.

4
00:00:20,359 --> 00:00:22,616
You know why, don't you?

5
00:00:22,698 --> 00:00:24,738
Leave this place.
Don't ever come back.

6
00:00:25,009 --> 00:00:26,000
What do you mean?

7
00:00:26,033 --> 00:00:28,033
They're still here. They never left.

8
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,300
Go see!

9
00:00:34,426 --> 00:00:37,876
Think it over. Figure out how to
get Khun Yo to accept us.

10
00:00:38,541 --> 00:00:40,083
...to let the three of us

11
00:00:40,853 --> 00:00:42,893
be a throuple.

12
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,750
(One year earlier)

13
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,330
You got married last year.

14
00:00:48,573 --> 00:00:49,693
Right.

15
00:00:49,879 --> 00:00:51,400
Your background is interesting.

16
00:00:52,528 --> 00:00:54,128
But a résumé

17
00:00:54,153 --> 00:00:57,553
can't tell me everything, can it?

18
00:01:13,119 --> 00:01:15,000
Why Void Architect?

19
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,200
I like a challenge.

20
00:01:19,987 --> 00:01:23,747
Void Architect is one
of the top ten architecture firms.

21
00:01:24,646 --> 00:01:26,646
Why wouldn't I want to work here?

22
00:01:29,439 --> 00:01:33,396
Anyone who works for me needs to know

23
00:01:34,466 --> 00:01:39,146
when to hold back and when to take a risk.

24
00:01:40,286 --> 00:01:42,286
So which are you?

25
00:01:44,246 --> 00:01:47,806
A safe player or a risk-taker?

26
00:01:48,399 --> 00:01:50,399
I know when to take risks.

27
00:01:50,986 --> 00:01:52,706
When the payoff is worth it.

28
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,120
Show me that your instincts

29
00:01:59,986 --> 00:02:02,546
are as good as your looks.

30
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,200
Disgusting.

31
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,600
I can't believe this.

32
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,880
How could you do this to me?

33
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:23,000
Yo, wait!
Yo, where are you going?

34
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:26,840
Yo, wait! Yo!

35
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:31,130
Yo, wait! Don't go.

36
00:04:17,860 --> 00:04:19,100
What the heck is this driving?

37
00:04:25,100 --> 00:04:27,460
Hey! You!

38
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:32,400
Hey! Hey, you! Open up!

39
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,160
Please hurry.

40
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:57,000
- Thanks so much.
- You're welcome.

41
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:07,400
The mechanic said the hard braking
damaged the electrical system.

42
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,800
It needs servicing.

43
00:05:11,039 --> 00:05:12,400
I called a tow truck.

44
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Thank you.

45
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:20,880
Are you okay?

46
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:27,360
I'm asking because
you weren't driving normally.

47
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:30,000
If you hadn't stopped in time,

48
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,680
- you and I...
- We'd both be dead.

49
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,440
My husband cheated on me.

50
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:10,000
I figured as much.

51
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:16,200
There aren't many things
that can shatter someone like this.

52
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:20,560
I don't understand.
What did I do wrong?

53
00:06:22,599 --> 00:06:26,000
When someone wants to leave,
they'll start a fight for no reason.

54
00:06:26,453 --> 00:06:30,053
Don't blame yourself.

55
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:37,200
I'm not saying
I don't have feelings.

56
00:06:40,199 --> 00:06:42,280
But if you've done your best,

57
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,900
you can't hold on to someone
who wants to leave.

58
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:53,000
What you can do is take care of your heart

59
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:55,220
and learn to love yourself again.

60
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:33,520
If you need to talk, give me a call.

61
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,560
Thank you.

62
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:57,120
Yo, wait!
Who's that guy? Where's the car?

63
00:07:58,159 --> 00:08:01,000
You think you still have
the right to ask me like that?

64
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:09,120
Yo, wait! I was worried about you.
Between me and Khun Pam...

65
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:11,080
Don't say another word.

66
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:16,440
Yo, wait! Please talk to me.

67
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,290
Please, wait.

68
00:08:20,315 --> 00:08:22,623
Yo, wait. Please stop.
Just hear me out.

69
00:08:23,886 --> 00:08:26,806
I'm sorry. I made a mistake.

70
00:08:27,073 --> 00:08:29,073
I never had feelings for Pam.

71
00:08:29,173 --> 00:08:32,173
And I don't think she ever had feelings
for me either, Yo.

72
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:34,780
You're only making it worse.

73
00:08:37,106 --> 00:08:38,506
You'd screw anyone.

74
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:42,040
Call me whatever you want.

75
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,920
I'll take all the blame.

76
00:08:45,043 --> 00:08:46,045
Yo.

77
00:08:46,826 --> 00:08:48,826
But I'll never leave you.

78
00:08:49,096 --> 00:08:52,160
Yo, Yo.
I'll cut off all contact with Khun Pam.

79
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:54,640
I'll cut Pam out of my life.

80
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:57,800
- Nat
- I'll prove it to you.

81
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,000
Why did you come back, Khun Pam?

82
00:09:04,546 --> 00:09:07,626
I was worried about you both.

83
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:11,040
You two shouldn't fight because of me.

84
00:09:12,821 --> 00:09:13,821
At least you know that.

85
00:09:14,332 --> 00:09:15,490
I just came to say...

86
00:09:16,556 --> 00:09:20,130
What happened between Nat and me
was just a mistake.

87
00:09:25,081 --> 00:09:28,810
You can keep the house deposit.

88
00:09:38,402 --> 00:09:40,002
Don't tell me this is Nat's price.

89
00:09:47,616 --> 00:09:50,016
- I don't sell or rent my husband.
- But you need the money.

90
00:09:51,235 --> 00:09:54,956
Your company is losing money.
You're drowning in debt.

91
00:09:55,464 --> 00:09:57,064
Plus the debt your family left you.

92
00:10:01,649 --> 00:10:03,249
You told her everything?

93
00:10:03,876 --> 00:10:05,076
I didn't, Yo.

94
00:10:12,330 --> 00:10:13,410
Please take it.

95
00:10:28,397 --> 00:10:29,707
I don't want it.

96
00:10:30,070 --> 00:10:31,717
But if you want to give me money,

97
00:10:32,143 --> 00:10:33,163
I'll see you in court.

98
00:10:33,710 --> 00:10:36,717
I'm sure I'll get more than 5 million.

99
00:10:42,403 --> 00:10:45,003
Khun Pam, please leave.

100
00:10:45,656 --> 00:10:47,096
I'll handle things with Yo.

101
00:10:55,743 --> 00:10:59,463
Yo, wait. Yo!
I'm not letting you go anywhere.

102
00:10:59,943 --> 00:11:02,772
Yo, wait! I'm sorry.

103
00:11:02,797 --> 00:11:04,517
I'm truly sorry, Yo.

104
00:11:06,137 --> 00:11:07,377
Why did you do this to me?

105
00:11:08,729 --> 00:11:11,150
- Why?
- I'm sorry, Yo.

106
00:11:13,756 --> 00:11:15,528
Get out! Get out!

107
00:11:16,116 --> 00:11:17,930
I'm sorry.

108
00:11:18,096 --> 00:11:18,717
I promised.

109
00:11:18,742 --> 00:11:21,542
I'll be the husband you deserve.

110
00:11:22,303 --> 00:11:23,616
Please, don't leave me.

111
00:11:24,717 --> 00:11:26,717
Please, don't leave me. I'm begging you.

112
00:11:26,717 --> 00:11:28,970
I'm begging you. Please...

113
00:11:29,043 --> 00:11:32,717
Please...

114
00:11:44,663 --> 00:11:47,863
I'm sorry, Yo. I'm so sorry.

115
00:11:51,110 --> 00:11:52,150
I'm sorry.

116
00:12:06,476 --> 00:12:08,090
No... No...

117
00:12:14,322 --> 00:12:15,463
I'm sorry.

118
00:13:16,842 --> 00:13:18,002
You're moving in?

119
00:13:18,436 --> 00:13:20,556
Didn't I tell you
to stay away from this place?

120
00:13:22,629 --> 00:13:24,429
I'm just here to warn you.

121
00:13:25,101 --> 00:13:26,335
Watch your back.

122
00:13:38,923 --> 00:13:40,283
Yo

123
00:13:42,157 --> 00:13:43,911
Great-Grandpa's house isn't haunted,

124
00:13:43,936 --> 00:13:46,455
despite those ghost stories
you paid that old lady to tell.

125
00:13:48,332 --> 00:13:50,332
It was passed down to me

126
00:13:50,723 --> 00:13:54,803
because it wasn't worth much.
Land here isn't expensive.

127
00:14:02,169 --> 00:14:04,490
But we can make it a wonderful home.

128
00:14:07,470 --> 00:14:08,951
Let's build a new life here, Yo.

129
00:14:10,051 --> 00:14:13,371
I'll make you forget
everything that happened,

130
00:14:14,391 --> 00:14:16,311
and earn your trust again.

131
00:14:46,624 --> 00:14:47,624
What is it, Nat?

132
00:14:49,423 --> 00:14:51,423
Nothing. Let's get inside.

133
00:15:26,424 --> 00:15:29,185
Khun Pam, you need to leave.
What if Yo sees you?

134
00:15:29,585 --> 00:15:32,025
What? Your wife?

135
00:15:32,338 --> 00:15:33,578
What's that got to do with me?

136
00:15:33,603 --> 00:15:35,603
I saw you outside Great-Grandpa's house.

137
00:15:36,763 --> 00:15:39,171
What are you talking about?
I'm at my condo.

138
00:15:44,358 --> 00:15:45,358
That's strange.

139
00:15:45,836 --> 00:15:47,626
Not really.

140
00:15:47,651 --> 00:15:51,451
We haven't seen each other for days.
You probably miss me.

141
00:15:51,931 --> 00:15:54,431
If you miss me, just come over.

142
00:15:55,825 --> 00:15:59,025
Please, Khun Pam.
It's over between us.

143
00:15:59,443 --> 00:16:02,724
Yo's the only one I love.
Stay away from me.

144
00:16:44,596 --> 00:16:48,837
Can we stop, Nat? I'm sleepy.

145
00:16:54,265 --> 00:16:55,265
Just sleep, then.

146
00:17:47,025 --> 00:17:49,425
You seem stressed, Khun Yo.

147
00:17:52,325 --> 00:17:54,205
Honestly, Whan,

148
00:17:55,557 --> 00:17:57,557
I still can't get over that day.

149
00:17:58,870 --> 00:18:01,271
But I believe in Khun Nat.

150
00:18:01,431 --> 00:18:04,431
He loves you more than Khun Pam.

151
00:18:06,345 --> 00:18:08,145
But she's still contacting him.

152
00:18:25,145 --> 00:18:29,225
(Khun Pam)

153
00:18:35,525 --> 00:18:37,165
(Khun Pam)

154
00:18:37,469 --> 00:18:38,469
(Call ended)
(Khun Pam)

155
00:18:45,344 --> 00:18:49,944
Even if Nat isn't interested,
I still can't shake the feeling.

156
00:18:51,025 --> 00:18:54,825
You try not to think about it,
but you just can't help it.

157
00:18:56,951 --> 00:18:59,951
For me, even now,

158
00:19:00,191 --> 00:19:03,591
I still can't get over
my boyfriend cheating on me.

159
00:19:04,557 --> 00:19:05,557
Huh?

160
00:19:10,157 --> 00:19:11,557
The reason he hit me...

161
00:19:13,298 --> 00:19:16,298
...was because
he was cheating on me.

162
00:19:18,625 --> 00:19:20,825
Are you gonna let him treat you like that?

163
00:19:24,697 --> 00:19:28,097
I... still love him.

164
00:19:36,098 --> 00:19:39,618
- No, Khun Yo. I'll check.
- Thanks.

165
00:19:45,197 --> 00:19:46,197
Yo.

166
00:19:50,964 --> 00:19:52,199
What are you doing?

167
00:19:52,538 --> 00:19:54,025
Editing a video.

168
00:19:56,111 --> 00:19:57,111
It's for you, Khun Nat.

169
00:20:00,725 --> 00:20:03,325
(Void Architect - Legal Department)

170
00:20:18,378 --> 00:20:19,778
Is something wrong, Nat?

171
00:20:20,584 --> 00:20:21,864
No, nothing.

172
00:20:28,425 --> 00:20:30,025
Why are you suing me?

173
00:20:31,025 --> 00:20:35,025
Not me. My company's huge.

174
00:20:35,025 --> 00:20:36,825
We have a whole board of directors.

175
00:20:37,825 --> 00:20:41,825
You didn't deliver the work. It cost
the company, so they had to sue you.

176
00:20:44,225 --> 00:20:47,125
But we agreed
to stay out of each other's lives.

177
00:20:48,625 --> 00:20:51,465
That was personal. This is business.

178
00:20:52,025 --> 00:20:56,125
I called you. You never answered.
So I had to inform the board.

179
00:20:56,745 --> 00:20:58,425
Are you trying to hurt Yo and me?

180
00:20:58,585 --> 00:21:01,825
No. I'm trying to help.

181
00:21:02,785 --> 00:21:04,785
You should finish your work.

182
00:21:04,811 --> 00:21:06,171
You can't just walk away.

183
00:21:14,018 --> 00:21:16,218
Didn't we agree that

184
00:21:16,911 --> 00:21:17,911
our affair

185
00:21:19,311 --> 00:21:20,711
would stay a secret?

186
00:21:34,723 --> 00:21:36,924
Don't be so distant.

187
00:21:46,105 --> 00:21:47,105
Enough, Khun Pam.

188
00:21:52,611 --> 00:21:53,651
No.

189
00:21:57,637 --> 00:22:02,438
I know you still want me.

190
00:22:05,025 --> 00:22:07,025
We shouldn't end this

191
00:22:07,025 --> 00:22:10,665
when we still want each other so badly.

192
00:22:12,630 --> 00:22:13,951
Don't leave me.

193
00:22:27,225 --> 00:22:28,665
I love you.

194
00:23:03,350 --> 00:23:05,791
Here's your tea. Careful, it's hot.

195
00:23:06,577 --> 00:23:08,057
Thanks, Whan.

196
00:23:10,677 --> 00:23:12,917
You should've gone with Khun Nat.

197
00:23:16,184 --> 00:23:18,025
I can't follow him everywhere.

198
00:23:18,991 --> 00:23:20,591
If I choose to stay,

199
00:23:21,344 --> 00:23:22,670
I have to trust him.

200
00:23:29,424 --> 00:23:33,464
But you still look stressed.
That's not good.

201
00:23:36,738 --> 00:23:41,618
Maybe I just need more sleep.
I'll go get some rest.

202
00:23:41,718 --> 00:23:43,718
You can head home, Whan.

203
00:23:44,798 --> 00:23:45,798
Not yet.

204
00:23:46,358 --> 00:23:48,258
I want to finish my work first.

205
00:23:50,024 --> 00:23:53,530
Alright.
I'm going to take a nap.

206
00:23:54,318 --> 00:23:55,318
Okay.

207
00:24:27,870 --> 00:24:28,670
What's up, Whan?

208
00:24:28,978 --> 00:24:31,150
Khun Nat, Khun Yo's really not well.

209
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:34,450
Is it serious?

210
00:24:34,905 --> 00:24:36,905
I think so.

211
00:24:36,905 --> 00:24:39,665
I've never seen her like this before.

212
00:24:40,011 --> 00:24:42,011
She just went upstairs to get some rest.

213
00:24:42,597 --> 00:24:44,678
Please look after Yo.
I'll be right back.

214
00:24:46,716 --> 00:24:47,917
Okay.

215
00:24:50,025 --> 00:24:51,505
I have to go.

216
00:24:53,351 --> 00:24:54,351
Wait.

217
00:24:55,551 --> 00:24:58,551
About your work, you need to come back
and finish it.

218
00:24:59,780 --> 00:25:01,340
I warn you.

219
00:25:01,445 --> 00:25:03,925
I don't want to see you get sued.

220
00:25:12,130 --> 00:25:13,131
Here.

221
00:25:14,265 --> 00:25:18,425
You're always welcome here
whenever you want.

222
00:25:56,478 --> 00:25:58,398
How's Khun Yo?

223
00:26:00,025 --> 00:26:01,465
She's sound asleep.

224
00:26:03,378 --> 00:26:05,018
You can head home now. It's late.

225
00:26:05,151 --> 00:26:06,871
I'll take care of her.

226
00:26:07,978 --> 00:26:08,978
Okay.

227
00:26:09,524 --> 00:26:12,524
And thanks for calling me.

228
00:26:25,744 --> 00:26:28,224
What was that? What happened?

229
00:26:29,071 --> 00:26:31,271
I don't know.
The light bulbs just burst.

230
00:26:33,158 --> 00:26:34,825
Just like that day.

231
00:26:36,678 --> 00:26:37,678
What day?

232
00:26:38,078 --> 00:26:41,078
The day Khun Pam came to see the house.

233
00:26:41,825 --> 00:26:45,025
She and Khun Nat were alone in that room.

234
00:26:45,025 --> 00:26:47,105
Then the vase fell and shattered.

235
00:26:48,024 --> 00:26:50,944
Whan! Why bring that up now?

236
00:26:56,736 --> 00:26:57,937
I'm sorry.

237
00:27:00,465 --> 00:27:02,658
I'll head home now.

238
00:27:05,171 --> 00:27:06,171
Okay.

239
00:27:15,537 --> 00:27:19,337
Nat, don't take it out on Whan.

240
00:27:19,513 --> 00:27:20,513
What happened between

241
00:27:20,538 --> 00:27:22,538
you and that woman
has nothing to do with Whan.

242
00:27:23,465 --> 00:27:26,065
Then I'll apologize to Whan myself.

243
00:27:49,450 --> 00:27:52,731
Are you home yet?
You left your iPad here.

244
00:27:53,078 --> 00:27:55,078
I'll let him know.

245
00:27:55,905 --> 00:27:57,025
Khun Yo.

246
00:27:58,378 --> 00:28:01,128
You can't answer
every call for your husband.

247
00:28:02,371 --> 00:28:03,811
Why not?

248
00:28:04,491 --> 00:28:07,051
I'm his legal wife.

249
00:28:07,465 --> 00:28:13,025
I don't have to sneak around
like someone's dirty little secret.

250
00:28:24,025 --> 00:28:26,425
Maybe you don't know, Yotaka...

251
00:28:27,425 --> 00:28:32,105
Sneaking around is always more exciting

252
00:28:32,425 --> 00:28:35,025
than what you already have.

253
00:28:46,158 --> 00:28:48,158
You're here sooner than I expected.

254
00:28:49,025 --> 00:28:50,025
Miss me already?

255
00:29:19,825 --> 00:29:23,825
If I looked like this,
would you still want me?

256
00:29:52,584 --> 00:29:54,505
I really was there for work.

257
00:29:54,644 --> 00:29:56,164
Nothing happened with Khun Pam.

258
00:29:57,977 --> 00:29:59,377
Trust me, Yo.

259
00:30:00,411 --> 00:30:02,051
If you were me...

260
00:30:02,669 --> 00:30:03,990
would you?

261
00:30:11,005 --> 00:30:16,164
(Pam - I dozed off earlier.
Had a bad dream about you. I'm worried.)

262
00:30:21,600 --> 00:30:26,025
Your iPad.
I'll get it back for you.

263
00:30:43,784 --> 00:30:46,984
You came all the way here?
Don't trust your husband?

264
00:30:49,464 --> 00:30:53,464
I trust my husband.
I just don't trust you.

265
00:30:54,151 --> 00:30:57,151
Then keep trusting him.

266
00:30:57,265 --> 00:30:59,265
But me and...

267
00:30:59,265 --> 00:31:02,225
Go ahead. Say it if you dare.
Even if I don't like what I hear,

268
00:31:02,225 --> 00:31:05,025
I want to hear what you have to say
about my husband.

269
00:31:05,025 --> 00:31:08,505
Better not. It's like a game.

270
00:31:09,025 --> 00:31:13,125
What's the fun
if you know what the next level is?

271
00:31:14,025 --> 00:31:17,025
Play by yourself. I'm done.

272
00:31:26,664 --> 00:31:29,065
Just wait. I'll make this even worse.

273
00:31:34,777 --> 00:31:36,578
Hi! Whan. Where's Yo?

274
00:31:37,145 --> 00:31:39,425
I don't know.
She left early this morning.

275
00:31:46,335 --> 00:31:48,135
(Nat)

276
00:31:52,025 --> 00:31:53,825
(Incoming Call - Nat)

277
00:31:54,237 --> 00:31:55,384
Hello, Yo.

278
00:31:55,978 --> 00:31:57,378
I've got your iPad.

279
00:32:04,184 --> 00:32:05,185
I've got to go.

280
00:32:06,591 --> 00:32:07,911
Wait, Yo.

281
00:32:24,551 --> 00:32:25,551
Hi!

282
00:32:26,185 --> 00:32:27,185
- Oh, you!

283
00:32:27,351 --> 00:32:28,751
What a coincidence.

284
00:32:29,245 --> 00:32:30,245
My car broke down.

285
00:32:32,025 --> 00:32:34,785
Just give me a minute to call a tow truck.

286
00:32:34,917 --> 00:32:35,917
Okay.

287
00:32:39,625 --> 00:32:44,475
(Nat)

288
00:32:50,304 --> 00:32:52,025
Is Khun Yo not answering?

289
00:32:53,897 --> 00:32:54,897
Still mad at me.

290
00:32:55,651 --> 00:32:58,491
May I try calling her?

291
00:33:27,864 --> 00:33:29,144
Khun Nat!
(Khun Yo)

292
00:33:33,344 --> 00:33:34,344
What's up, Whan?

293
00:33:35,044 --> 00:33:38,044
Khun Yo, where are you now?

294
00:33:38,945 --> 00:33:40,825
Khun Nat's really worried about you.

295
00:33:42,545 --> 00:33:44,505
Tell him not to worry.

296
00:33:46,825 --> 00:33:50,625
I'll be home late tonight.
You can go home. Don't wait for me.

297
00:33:51,637 --> 00:33:55,997
Okay. Oh...
Do you want to talk to Khun Nat?

298
00:33:56,645 --> 00:33:58,245
He's right here.

299
00:33:58,644 --> 00:33:59,644
I'd rather not.

300
00:34:06,225 --> 00:34:08,879
Khun Yo said she'll be home late.

301
00:34:08,904 --> 00:34:10,304
No need to worry.

302
00:34:21,098 --> 00:34:22,298
Here you go.

303
00:34:37,021 --> 00:34:39,581
Can I scan your QR code to pay you back?

304
00:34:40,125 --> 00:34:43,119
For the tow truck you paid for.

305
00:34:43,144 --> 00:34:44,145
Oh, right!

306
00:34:47,295 --> 00:34:48,295
Here.

307
00:34:55,305 --> 00:34:56,625
- Thank you.
- Thanks.

308
00:35:01,170 --> 00:35:03,970
You know, I felt really bad.

309
00:35:05,145 --> 00:35:07,145
You helped me,
and then I disappeared.

310
00:35:07,309 --> 00:35:09,950
Don't worry. I didn't mind.

311
00:35:13,270 --> 00:35:16,150
So... how are you?
Feeling any better?

312
00:35:19,558 --> 00:35:20,558
I guess.

313
00:35:21,410 --> 00:35:24,210
Is that a yes or a no?

314
00:35:40,743 --> 00:35:44,143
Khun Pam...
You and Yo aren't fighting, right?

315
00:35:45,025 --> 00:35:48,025
Actually, I wish we had.
But she didn't.

316
00:35:48,485 --> 00:35:50,665
I'm calling about work,
not for you to mess with me.

317
00:35:50,905 --> 00:35:52,585
If that's all...

318
00:35:52,585 --> 00:35:53,585
Wait.

319
00:35:54,540 --> 00:35:55,540
What is it?

320
00:35:58,144 --> 00:35:59,225
I have something for you.

321
00:36:00,025 --> 00:36:01,025
What?

322
00:36:01,644 --> 00:36:03,025
Just check your iPad.

323
00:36:05,025 --> 00:36:06,025
Don't send anything.

324
00:36:06,025 --> 00:36:08,025
You know Yo has my iPad.

325
00:36:09,185 --> 00:36:10,785
Exactly.

326
00:36:11,217 --> 00:36:13,373
So if you don't want me to,

327
00:36:13,655 --> 00:36:16,055
meet me tomorrow.

328
00:36:16,425 --> 00:36:20,025
I have a new project for you.
See you then.

329
00:36:55,837 --> 00:36:57,877
Need anything else, Khun Nat?

330
00:36:59,121 --> 00:37:01,921
I can make you some snacks.

331
00:37:02,576 --> 00:37:04,896
No, it's late.
You should head home.

332
00:37:08,145 --> 00:37:11,025
Let me stay with you.

333
00:37:12,025 --> 00:37:14,025
Until Khun Yo gets back.

334
00:37:15,025 --> 00:37:18,585
Everything's such a mess right now.

335
00:37:18,585 --> 00:37:20,025
I understand.

336
00:37:27,037 --> 00:37:28,287
No matter what,

337
00:37:35,324 --> 00:37:37,524
I'm always here for you, Khun Nat.

338
00:37:47,225 --> 00:37:48,425
Have a drink?

339
00:37:56,611 --> 00:37:57,611
Sure.

340
00:38:18,025 --> 00:38:19,825
If I were Khun Yo,

341
00:38:21,025 --> 00:38:23,505
I wouldn't keep bothering you
about Khun Pam.

342
00:38:25,851 --> 00:38:30,891
But I'd take care of you

343
00:38:31,098 --> 00:38:33,098
and give you everything you need.

344
00:38:39,684 --> 00:38:41,084
Take care of everything, really?

345
00:39:42,757 --> 00:39:45,438
I'll expose what you really are.

346
00:39:58,505 --> 00:40:00,065
I knew you'd come.

347
00:40:00,898 --> 00:40:03,098
Not what you expected, huh?
Nat's not here with me.

348
00:40:05,030 --> 00:40:08,951
You should spend your time
keeping an eye on your assistant.

349
00:40:10,665 --> 00:40:12,425
You think everyone's like you?

350
00:40:12,425 --> 00:40:13,825
That's exactly why.

351
00:40:13,825 --> 00:40:17,025
And that's why
you took advantage of me.

352
00:40:17,425 --> 00:40:19,585
Say whatever you want,

353
00:40:19,844 --> 00:40:21,444
but don't pretend you're innocent.

354
00:40:21,985 --> 00:40:23,585
It doesn't make you look any smarter.

355
00:40:25,752 --> 00:40:28,152
If you say it's over, then end it.

356
00:40:28,767 --> 00:40:31,247
Yet here you are, stalking me.

357
00:41:08,375 --> 00:41:11,935
Don't let Yo find out about this. Got it?

358
00:41:12,863 --> 00:41:14,343
I won't.

359
00:41:15,396 --> 00:41:17,436
You should head home now.

360
00:41:30,085 --> 00:41:31,085
(Khun Yo)

361
00:41:33,265 --> 00:41:35,025
Don't tell Yo you're still here.

362
00:41:38,884 --> 00:41:39,884
Yes, Khun Yo.

363
00:41:40,511 --> 00:41:42,111
You were right.

364
00:41:42,825 --> 00:41:45,825
Pam's a real snake.

365
00:41:46,851 --> 00:41:48,891
Where are you now?

366
00:41:49,025 --> 00:41:50,025
At her condo.

367
00:41:51,025 --> 00:41:54,025
Want me to go over there
and deal with her?

368
00:41:54,025 --> 00:41:56,025
Oh, please! Who does that?

369
00:41:56,785 --> 00:41:58,585
I was just mad.

370
00:42:01,025 --> 00:42:03,025
I have to go.
I'm heading home now.

371
00:42:05,091 --> 00:42:06,891
Which home?

372
00:42:09,510 --> 00:42:11,711
Great-Grandpa's house. Why?

373
00:42:11,800 --> 00:42:15,800
Oh, nothing. I just thought...

374
00:42:15,825 --> 00:42:20,025
That you'd be too mad at Khun Nat
to go back there.

375
00:42:20,905 --> 00:42:23,745
To be honest,
I don't want to see him just yet.

376
00:42:25,745 --> 00:42:29,025
Then I'll stay
at my Bangkok house tonight.

377
00:42:29,225 --> 00:42:31,225
Meet me there tomorrow.

378
00:42:32,745 --> 00:42:36,425
Okay. But if you want to deal with
that snake,

379
00:42:36,425 --> 00:42:39,505
Just call me anytime. I'm on standby.

380
00:42:39,952 --> 00:42:41,472
Alright. Bye.

381
00:42:46,425 --> 00:42:48,065
Go home.

382
00:42:59,905 --> 00:43:04,465
Go home. Go home.

383
00:43:08,305 --> 00:43:11,025
Khun Yo's not coming back tonight.

384
00:43:11,025 --> 00:43:13,025
She said she's staying in Bangkok.

385
00:43:16,425 --> 00:43:19,025
(301 Detective Office)

386
00:43:40,289 --> 00:43:41,290
What's up, Pete?

387
00:43:41,831 --> 00:43:44,831
I got off work early. Want to meet up?

388
00:43:45,337 --> 00:43:46,937
Or you'll say I never make time for you.

389
00:43:48,898 --> 00:43:50,190
I'm tied up today too.

390
00:43:50,816 --> 00:43:52,316
You're not the only one who's busy.

391
00:43:55,404 --> 00:43:56,404
Okay.

392
00:43:57,675 --> 00:44:00,330
We'll meet when we're both free, then.

393
00:44:12,185 --> 00:44:14,585
Yo's not answering. I'll go see her.

394
00:44:16,645 --> 00:44:17,945
What about me?

395
00:44:18,331 --> 00:44:19,331
You just go home.

396
00:44:20,825 --> 00:44:24,425
Can I stay with you tonight?

397
00:44:25,677 --> 00:44:29,877
I just feel like...
tonight is a first for us.

398
00:44:30,323 --> 00:44:32,084
It won't be our last.

399
00:44:33,084 --> 00:44:34,123
Khun Nat.

400
00:44:34,163 --> 00:44:35,644
Or will it end tonight?

401
00:44:42,185 --> 00:44:43,185
Okay.

402
00:44:45,991 --> 00:44:49,711
But how are you going to get
to Khun Yo? You don't have a car.

403
00:44:50,010 --> 00:44:51,011
Oh, right!

404
00:44:52,871 --> 00:44:54,121
But you have to go home.

405
00:44:54,785 --> 00:44:58,095
And remember...
don't let Yo find out about this.

406
00:45:28,025 --> 00:45:31,025
Oh, Yo! You're back? Changed your mind?

407
00:46:10,025 --> 00:46:11,225
What the hell?!

408
00:46:14,185 --> 00:46:15,185
Damn it!

409
00:46:16,465 --> 00:46:18,465
Where am I gonna find
an electrician this late?

410
00:46:38,377 --> 00:46:40,777
Excuse me!

411
00:46:42,550 --> 00:46:45,050
Excuse me!

412
00:46:46,544 --> 00:46:49,004
Excuse me!

413
00:46:54,332 --> 00:46:55,652
Hey, you!

414
00:47:02,025 --> 00:47:05,305
Excuse me!

415
00:47:15,540 --> 00:47:18,740
Excuse me!

416
00:47:21,758 --> 00:47:23,508
Is there an electrician around here?

417
00:47:27,025 --> 00:47:28,025
Yes.

418
00:47:28,025 --> 00:47:29,545
Where is he?

419
00:47:33,331 --> 00:47:35,211
Hey!

420
00:47:37,077 --> 00:47:38,777
You could at least answer me!

421
00:48:02,465 --> 00:48:04,025
I have a bad feeling.

422
00:48:05,025 --> 00:48:06,425
Stay home with me, Nat.

423
00:48:06,425 --> 00:48:08,425
Your wife's getting worse.

424
00:48:08,825 --> 00:48:10,145
You should take her to a doctor.

425
00:48:11,425 --> 00:48:13,825
Can I stay here with you?

426
00:48:13,985 --> 00:48:15,425
I know what you're up to.

427
00:48:16,417 --> 00:48:18,717
How long do I have to play dumb

428
00:48:20,085 --> 00:48:21,285
before you leave her?

429
00:48:22,044 --> 00:48:23,991
And I'm working myself to the bone

430
00:48:24,191 --> 00:48:26,151
You should know why.

431
00:48:27,625 --> 00:48:30,825
Follow me! You're dead!
